

In the event of multiple GPU cards installed be sure to check the
bullshit NVidia "compute" level crap number which determines the
version of the internal PTX code base to build into the output
binary blob.

see https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-gpus

Where I need 3.5 and 5.0 and also 6.0

C_titan$ nvcc -ccbin /usr/bin/g++-10 -I../include -m64 -gencode arch=compute_35,code=sm_35 -gencode arch=compute_50,code=sm_50 -gencode arch=compute_60,code=sm_60 -Wno-deprecated-gpu-targets -lnppi_static -lculibos -c -o dev_info.o dev_info.cpp
C_titan$ nvcc -ccbin /usr/bin/g++-10 -I../include -m64 -gencode arch=compute_35,code=sm_35 -gencode arch=compute_50,code=sm_50 -gencode arch=compute_60,code=sm_60 -Wno-deprecated-gpu-targets -o dev_info dev_info.o 
C_titan$ 


